# Private model profiles are NOT committed to this repo - github allows
# dropping any number of your own *.sh files here (or copying them out of
# the private presets repo), and they stay untracked. This allowlist keeps
# only the shipped example profile and its docs in git. Note: this pattern
# uses explicit filenames on purpose - a "!*/" re-include would un-ignore
# every subdirectory under this folder as well.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!gemma4-e2b.sh